WHAT THIS COVERS
The source code, design, and original graphics in this repository
(including the TOPA name and logo). It is shared publicly for viewing
as a personal portfolio piece. No permission is granted to copy, modify,
distribute, or use it without written permission from the author.

WHAT THIS DOES NOT COVER
This project displays content it does not own, and claims no rights to it:

- Show listings (bands, dates, venues, addresses) are from the public
  Ventura Rocks calendar (venturarocks.com) and from the bands, fans, and
  venues who send them to TOPA.
- Band and venue photos sent to TOPA belong to whoever sent them, who
  confirmed they can share them.
- 30-second previews and album art are streamed from Apple Music under
  Apple's own terms. None are stored in this repository.
- Band names, venue names, and any trademarks belong to their owners.
  Their appearance here does not mean they endorse or are affiliated
  with this project.
